<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in Nov 6 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in Nov 6 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED NOVEMBER 6</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............767,500 up.......300</p>
<p> Govt, agency securities...707,000 up.....3,200</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......469,200 down...3,700</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....756,190 down...2,715</p>
<p> Financial companies.......570,776 down...3,303</p>
<p> New York business loans....42,987 down......92</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......42,726 down.....103</p>
</text>
